---
title: Cortex AI — implemented local evidence boundary
---
flowchart TB
  B[React browser<br/>Vite /api proxy or built same-origin assets] --> A[FastAPI loopback<br/>Origin, body bounds, opaque cookie]
  A --> G[Exclusive process gate + one SQLite transaction<br/>ONE application worker]
  G --> I[Trusted current identity<br/>CSRF, action roles, explicit document READ]
  I --> Q[Permission + approval + date + scope SQL filters<br/>FTS5 eligible IDs]
  Q --> P[Hydrate authorized peer evidence only<br/>Maximum 100 peers]
  P --> C[Reviewed numeric claims + authority<br/>Equal-strength disagreement abstains]
  C --> V[Reauthorize source dependency<br/>Check exact span, hash and revisions]
  V --> R[Offline evidence answer or abstention<br/>At most 8 citations; owner-only history]
  R --> B
  I --> U[Upload action + private generated file path<br/>TXT, text PDF, DOCX; 10 MiB]
  U --> W[Bounded parser child<br/>30-second timeout; NOT OS-sandboxed]
  W --> D[Immutable source text and hash<br/>Failed or pending review; not answer context]
  D --> T[Authorized reviewer verifies uniform access<br/>One span, source kind, dates, scope and numeric claim]
  T --> F[Atomic metadata, claim and FTS publication<br/>Increment knowledge revision]
  F --> Q
  I --> M[Action + READ checked ACL / role edits<br/>Same gate; increment policy revision]
  M --> H[Later history / source requests reauthorized<br/>Changed dependency or revision withheld]
  H --> B
  S[(Private SQLite + upload directory<br/>21 domain tables and FTS5; ignored by Git)] --- G
  S --- D
  N[Absent: LLM, agents, vectors, cache, chunk ACLs<br/>General amendment reasoning and multiworker deployment] -. later work .-> C
